CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/ay com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/PhysicalObject
	COMMENT PhysicalObject - RenderedObject with a display/collision box. Fields: width (spriteWidth, set by T(int) which also sets halfWidth) and spriteHeight (set by U(int), which also sets halfHeight), halfWidth/halfHeight (the half extents; the T/U setters use integer division and V/W the float variant), usingTextureSize (true when the box came from a texture via b(BitmapOrTexture), false via a(BitmapOrTexture,int)). NOTE: the obfuscated field e t is named spriteHeight rather than the obvious "height" only because GameObject.height (the z position, eq) already occupies that name in this hierarchy. [field names derived from code]
	FIELD es spriteWidth I
	FIELD et spriteHeight I
	FIELD eu halfWidth F
	FIELD ev halfHeight F
	FIELD ew usingTextureSize Z
